  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: 普 通 ある程度耐えますが 高温多湿は嫌います（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜明るい日陰／暖地: 昼過ぎから半日陰が理想（西日 △ 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Plants prefer some part afternoon shade in the St.\n[MBG/品種] In hot summer climates, the primary bloom runs from late spring to early summer (June - July) with a lighter bloom continuing throughout summer into fall.\n[MBG/品種] If bloom interrupts in the heat of the summer, plants can be cut back to rejuvenate, shape and/or encourage a late summer/early fall rebloom.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or East-facing or South-facing or North-facing",
